# Review

Canonical source: `skills/review/SKILL.md`.

## When To Use

- Slice stable after implement/diagnose.
- User asks review, verify, final checks, or ready proof.

## Inputs

- `skills/review/SKILL.md` and its references when mid/high-risk.
- Diff facts, Spec/Plan, success criteria, recovery, project check commands.

## Procedure

1. Restate ready claim.
2. Mid/high-risk: independent read-only subagent adversarial pass (`subagent` | `packet_fallback` only).
3. Run fresh checks; map criteria; cold subagent when mid/high-risk.
4. Ready only if no Critical and required criteria all pass → cleanup.

## Outputs

- REVIEW + VERIFICATION + READY verdict and Next skill.

## Verification / Done Criteria

- Mid/high-risk used subagent or cannot claim ready.
- Unknown ≠ ready. No code fixes in this skill.
